	(text "/INT is pulled up to LDO1\nWhen the RTC sends an interrupt it lowers /INT\nThis creates a pulse on N_OE \n(N_OE is normally low, the C19/R7 ensures N_OE returns to low)\nWhen AXP209 sees N_OE going back to low it enables it's outputs\nand everything boots.\nNothing happens to N_OE when /INT goes back to high again after interrupt\nis cleared after boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.136 38.862 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5b6f0dfa-1a5f-44a8-9e1f-231e5efb9157")
	)
